From a27bbe031f27265a125e6d1b037a087a1e00f672 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "sh.chao" <sh.chao@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 15:07:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] r25-1-0088: attribute RenderProgram costs

Add bounded Android telemetry for already-large holders without changing
rendering policy or pixel ownership. Retain admitted RenderProgram and spatial
index lifecycle timings, expose fixed cursor counters for queried bins and raw
postings, and report query, replay, packet, fallback, and memory metrics from
both native render entry points.

Normal holders below 4096 commands continue through the unmeasured 0087 path.
The patch adds no rendering eligibility, candidate, ordering, rasterization,
cache, allocation, lock, JNI, Kotlin, or destination-pixel policy.
